  "description": "This Draft Standard for Trial Use contains the format and establishes the data contents of the Annuity Activity Transaction Set (268) for use within the context of an Electronic Data Interchange (EDI) environment. The transaction set is used to convey annuity account activity from annuity providers to distributors (e.g., broker/dealers, financial planners, banks, savings and loans) for the purpose of communicating account positions and transaction activity.",
